  {
    "name": "POST /api/Products/bulk - 按UPC批量添加产品到广告组+连带测试PUT改状态/PATCH按条件批量改状态(改回原值)",
    "description": "写操作：POST bulk按UPC(00111111111117)批量添加产品到测试adgroup；PUT bulk对自己product_id先禁用再恢复启用；PATCH status/byConditions缩小范围到自己campaign_id，先禁用再恢复启用。用户2026-09-28拍板执行。已用curl手工验证过一遍完整链路成功。2026-09-28收尾复核：POST bulk绑定的测试UPC(00111111111117→productId 127e3839...)没有解绑/删除接口，会作为绑定记录留在测试adgroup下(重跑时POST bulk会返回successCount=0\"已存在\"但HTTP/code仍200)；已用PUT bulk把该测试产品置为enabled=false作为最小影响清理，原有产品(product_id, UPC 00001231231232)经ES 09-27快照核对仍是原始enabled=true。",
    "module": "Products",
    "granularity": "API",
    "since": "init",
    "last_modified": "init",
    "change_type": "NEW",
    "generated_by": "swagger-api-case",
    "steps": [
      {
        "name": "按UPC批量添加产品到广告组",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.INSTACARTBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "Products/bulk",
        "request_body": {
          "ProfileId": "{{variables.profile_id}}",
          "AdGroupIds": [
            "{{variables.adgroup_id}}"
          ],
          "Upcs": [
            "00111111111117"
          ]
        },
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "禁用自己的测试产品",
        "method": "PUT",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.INSTACARTBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "Products/bulk",
        "request_body": [
          {
            "productId": "{{variables.product_id}}",
            "profileId": "{{variables.profile_id}}",
            "enabled": false
          }
        ],
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "恢复启用自己的测试产品",
        "method": "PUT",
        "base_url": "{{base_urls.INSTACARTBASEURL}}",
        "headers": "{{headers}}",
        "path": "Products/bulk",
        "request_body": [
          {
            "productId": "{{variables.product_id}}",
            "profileId": "{{variables.profile_id}}",
            "enabled": true
          }
        ],
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200
        }
      },
      {
